# QA Q3 (fixed in T20b): rebinding Use item (keyboard A) to C, which Camera uses, swaps the two:
# Camera receives E (Use item's previous key), the notice says "Swapped with Camera"; Reset
# bindings clears the notice.
wait ui
wait screen title
0.3 nav keyboardA confirm          # Title
wait screen main
0.3 nav keyboardA up
0.3 nav keyboardA up
0.3 nav keyboardA up               # Settings
0.3 nav keyboardA confirm
wait screen settings
0.3 nav keyboardA nextTab          # Graphics
0.4 nav keyboardA nextTab          # Audio
0.4 nav keyboardA nextTab          # Controls (scheme Keyboard A)
0.6 nav keyboardA down             # Throttle
0.3 nav keyboardA down             # Brake
0.3 nav keyboardA down             # Steer left
0.3 nav keyboardA down             # Steer right
0.3 nav keyboardA down             # Drift
0.3 nav keyboardA down             # Use item
0.3 nav keyboardA confirm          # capture
0.6 tap keyboardA camera           # C
1.0 shot rb_01_after_rebind        # Use item: C, Camera: E, "Swapped with Camera"
0.3 nav keyboardA down             # Boost
0.3 nav keyboardA down             # Look back
0.3 nav keyboardA down             # Reset
0.3 nav keyboardA down             # Camera
0.3 nav keyboardA down             # Pause
0.3 nav keyboardA down             # Reset bindings
0.3 nav keyboardA confirm
1.0 shot rb_02_after_reset         # defaults back, no notice
1.5 exit
